From fda22de26bb44020fa8eea46638367e4dab1c7cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: idiazraz <100824525+idiazraz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] airoha: en7523: add EN7523 AX3000 baseline from Kiwironic

Bring in the EN7523 board support from Kiwironic/openwrt-en7523 (itself a
subset of openwrt/openwrt#20104 and related trees) as the base for the
Skyworth GN630V port:

- EN7523 Ethernet/DSA/PCS series (930-42..51), EcoNet NPU driver (950)
  and the PCIe root port BAR0 quirk (960)
- 930-43: ID_EN7523 = 7, upstream now uses 6 for EN7528
- 930-45: refresh the airoha_eth.h hunk for the current RX_DSCP_NUM
- 930-46: register the PCS provider with devm_fwnode_pcs_add_provider()
  and drop .remove, phylink_release_pcs() no longer exists
- drop 930-52 and the mt76 LED cflags patch, both already upstream
- en7523 kernel config: enable PCS_AIROHA_EN7523, NPU left off
- image: load the kernel at 0x80208000 (ARM TEXT_OFFSET)
- EN7523 AX3000 router dts, base-files and wpad.init without ujail
